ps://datacite-metadata-schema.readthedocs.io/en/4.5/appendices/appendix-1/relationType/#continues\">Continues</a></td>\n<td style=\"height: 39.2px;\"><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15538195\">INR18650-LG-3500-MJ1 Cathode GITT Features</a></td>\n<td style=\"height: 39.2px;\">This record contains features observed in the GITT (without intermittent EIS) measurement on the harvested negative electrode (anode) of the INR18650-MJ1 cylindrical 18650 cell from LG CHEM. It also serves as input for EP-BOLFI parameterization.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 19.6px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 19.6px;\"><a href=\"https://datacite-metadata-schema.readthedocs.io/en/4.5/appendices/appendix-1/relationType/#continues\">Continues</a></td>\n<td style=\"height: 19.6px;\"><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15538173\">INR18650-LG-3500-MJ1 Cathode GITT Parameter Collection</a></td>\n<td style=\"height: 19.6px;\">This record contains workflows to collect the parameterizations on individual SOC points with EP-BOLFI of a GITT without intermittent EIS) measurement on the harvested positive electrode (cathode) of an INR18650-MJ1 Li-ion cell from LG CHEM. The result is a reasonable fitting spline for each estimated parameter as a function of SOC.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 19.6px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 19.6px;\"><a href=\"https://datacite-metadata-schema.readthedocs.io/en/4.5/appendices/appendix-1/relationType/#iscontinuedby\">IsContinuedBy</a></td>\n<td style=\"height: 19.6px;\"><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15496570\">INR18650-LG-3500-MJ1 Lithium-Ion Battery Cell Complete Continuum Simulation Parameters</a></td>\n<td style=\"height: 19.6px;\">This record contains a complete and PyBaMM-compatible parameter set for the INR18650-LG-3500-MJ1 cell and incomplete versions of it that were used in an exempular GITT characterization workflow. Most parameters are repackaged laboratory measurement results and SOC alignment checks with a GITT (without intermittent EIS) measurement on 